"""Nasdaq-calendar + QC/LEAN earnings options scanner entrypoint.

Stage 1 calendar: free Nasdaq public earnings calendar API.
Stage 2+ evidence: QC/LEAN option-chain/liquidity/Greeks/history only.
No Yahoo/yfinance.
"""
